                Useful Links
              </p>
              <ul class="text-[16px] font-[500] mt-[16px] leading-loose">
                <li><a href="Regulatory.html">Regulatory Information</a></li>
                <li>
                  <a href="About.html#Associated_Company"
                    >Associated Companies</a
                  >
                </li>
                <li><a href="Resources.html#related_forms">Downloads</a></li>
                <li><a href="NewReport.html">Reports & Statements</a></li>
                <li><a href="">Investor Complaints</a></li>
                <li>
                  <a
                    href="https://www.psx.com.pk/psx/resources-and-tools/investors/investors-complaints"
