                Contact
              </p>
              <ul class="text-[16px] font-[500] mt-[16px] leading-loose">
                <li><a href="">+92-4235741714-15</a></li>
                <li><a href="">+92-4235692606</a></li>
                <li>
                  <a
                    href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=info@iel.net.pk"
                    target="_blank"
